<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:55:37 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>日本 40 年期债券发行因避险情绪而需求减弱</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/japan-40-year-bond-sale-sees-weaker-demand-than-12-month-average-mwvkr2jb</link><description>由于全球避险情绪打压投资者胃口，周三日本 40 年期政府债券拍卖导致需求疲软。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/japan-40-year-bond-sale-sees-weaker-demand-than-12-month-average-mwvkr2jb'&gt;日本 40 年期债券发行因避险情绪而需求减弱&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Japan’s 40-Year Bond Sale Draws Weaker Demand on Risk Off Mood&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/japan-40-year-bond-sale-sees-weaker-demand-than-12-month-average-mwvkr2jb</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:39:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>澳大利亚击败中国在所罗门群岛的太平洋立足点</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/australia-aims-to-sign-another-deal-to-block-china-in-pacific</link><description>澳大利亚与所罗门群岛签署了一项新条约，旨在阻止中国进入太平洋，部分扭转了北京三年前在该地区取得的进展，令美国及其盟友感到震惊。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/australia-aims-to-sign-another-deal-to-block-china-in-pacific'&gt;澳大利亚击败中国在所罗门群岛的太平洋立足点&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia Edges China Out of Pacific Foothold in Solomon Islands&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/australia-aims-to-sign-another-deal-to-block-china-in-pacific</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:01:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着人工智能的担忧让台积电、SK 海力士股价下跌，Huang Boost 迅速消退</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jensen-huang-boost-fades-fast-as-taiwan-stocks-tumble-8</link><description>随着投资者重新关注全球人工智能行业的担忧，亚洲股市对黄仁勋职业生涯复兴的热情周三消失。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jensen-huang-boost-fades-fast-as-taiwan-stocks-tumble-8'&gt;随着人工智能的担忧让台积电、SK 海力士股价下跌，Huang Boost 迅速消退&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Huang Boost Fades Quickly as AI Fears Sink TSMC, SK Hynix Shares&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jensen-huang-boost-fades-fast-as-taiwan-stocks-tumble-8</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:45:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>丹格特炼油厂将成为非洲最大的上市公司</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dangote-refinery-set-to-become-africa-s-biggest-listed-company</link><description>一旦在拉各斯首次上市，丹格特石油炼油和石化FZE将成为非洲最大的首次上市公司，其规模远远超过非洲大陆第二大企业的规模。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dangote-refinery-set-to-become-africa-s-biggest-listed-company'&gt;丹格特炼油厂将成为非洲最大的上市公司&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Dangote Refinery Set to Become Africa’s Biggest Listed Company&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dangote-refinery-set-to-become-africa-s-biggest-listed-company</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:15:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>习近平调查上海领导人，扩大政治变动</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/xi-probes-shanghai-boss-widening-political-shakeup-video</link><description>中国已对中央政治局委员、上海市委书记陈吉宁涉嫌严重违纪违法立案调查。彭博经济研究公司的尼尔·托马斯 (Neil Thomas) 有这样的背景。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/xi-probes-shanghai-boss-widening-political-shakeup-video'&gt;习近平调查上海领导人，扩大政治变动&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Xi Probes Shanghai Boss, Widening Political Shakeup&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/xi-probes-shanghai-boss-widening-political-shakeup-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:25:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</link><description>由于原油供应增加的迹象超过了霍尔木兹海峡周围船只遭受的袭击升级，油价下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25'&gt;11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 25&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:06:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着芯片限制影响数据中心项目，马来亚银行审查投资组合</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/maybank-reviews-portfolio-as-chip-curbs-hit-data-center-projects</link><description>马来西亚最大的银行正在审查其投资组合，以了解美国最新芯片限制措施的潜在风险，同时评估这些限制可能如何影响数据中心客户及其融资需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/maybank-reviews-portfolio-as-chip-curbs-hit-data-center-projects'&gt;随着芯片限制影响数据中心项目，马来亚银行审查投资组合&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Maybank Reviews Portfolio as Chip Curbs Hit Data Center Projects&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/maybank-reviews-portfolio-as-chip-curbs-hit-data-center-projects</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:35:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着人工智能贸易衰退、石油价格下跌，股票损失加剧：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>由于对人工智能繁荣持久性的怀疑导致科技股撤退，股票遭到抛售，期货进一步走软。国债因避险需求而上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着人工智能贸易衰退、石油价格下跌，股票损失加剧：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stock Losses Build as AI Trade Falters, Oil Drops: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>